    <!-- Screen 14 - About Screen -->
    <string name="about_title">About Us</string>
    <string name="about_body">MMM Social Workers &amp; Associates provides compassionate, confidential and evidence-based counselling services for individuals, families, couples and organisations across Midrand, Johannesburg, Centurion, and online.\n\nOur Mission: To empower individuals, families and communities through compassionate, ethical and evidence-based social work services.\n\nOur Vision: To become a trusted leader in professional social work by promoting wellbeing, resilience and positive social change.\n\nOur Values: Integrity, compassion, respect, confidentiality and professionalism guide everything we do.</string>

    <!-- Screen 15 - Privacy Policy Screen -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">MMM Social Workers &amp; Associates is committed to protecting your personal information in accordance with the Protection of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA).\n\nInformation collected through this app (your name, email, phone number, and booking details) is used solely to manage your appointments with the practice, and is not shared with third parties beyond what is necessary to provide this service.\n\nYou may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time via the Settings screen or by contacting the practice directly.</string>

    <!-- Screen 16 - Terms and Conditions Screen -->
    <string name="terms_title">Terms and Conditions</string>
    <string name="terms_body">By using this application, you agree to provide accurate information when registering and booking appointments.\n\nBookings submitted through this app are requests and are subject to confirmation by MMM Social Workers &amp; Associates. Session fees will be confirmed by our team before your appointment is finalised.\n\nCancellations made through the app are permanent. To reschedule, please contact the practice directly.\n\nThis application does not process payments and does not generate video consultation links; both are arranged directly with the practice.</string>

